{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026waddaz2V5S1794881023.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太經合組織(APEC)第33次領導人非正式會議將於明、後兩天在深圳舉行，而今、明兩日就舉行工商領導人峰會。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SZ.APEC-0930.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ufNsj8QVsn1794881096.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>工商領導人峰會在前海國際會議中心舉行，會場附近保安增強，多國代表陸續抵達。峰會有七場專題研討會，涵蓋人工智能(AI)、亞太可持續發展等議題，預計有逾2,000名來自政商界等人士參與。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SZ.APEC-0930_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rqTuC9ofSq1794881108.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>香港亦是APEC成員經濟體，行政長官李家超今日啟程往深圳，分別出席工商領導人峰會及領導人非正式會議，期間會與其他經濟體領導人舉行雙邊會談、深化合作。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T02:46:50.981311+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T01:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T00:15:54.133076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T02:40:14.942509+00:00","content_hash":"7d162f521ea0de4682791901df2435f9219f2d783dcf3fd12a9794c306649428","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T02:46:50.981311+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}